==Battleground==
*15 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*8 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 5~15 seconds<sup>150f~450f</sup>.
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dober P.D]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Gobble]]s spawn, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**2 [[Kory|Kories]] spawn, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
While Gobble seems like a major pain here, his low endurance means you can abuse Dober as a stepping stone and constantly knock him back. At the beginning of the level, use your base and Duche to stack [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], and to send out [[Jagando Jr. (Special Cat)|Jagando]]. On base hit, your Hitmen will murder everyone while Gobble gets constantly knockbacked by Jagando's Surge and the Hitman stack. Note that any [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] Ubers you have work well in this stage.

